joshua_russo: Could bash someone’s head in with that thing.
player: It’s pretty heavy, yeah. [pause=2]\
(The cover almost looks swollen, and it smells horrible. Is this leather?)
joshua_russo: Give it here real quick.
Russo grabs both covers of the book, spreads them out, and shakes the book around. [pause=0.5]After we heard a small ripping noise, he quickly shut it.
joshua_russo: No luck there. Damn.
player: Since they tried so hard to hide this book, couldn’t the book itself be the valuable?
